// Cross-benefit recovery applied to payment.
// Module 04-recouvrement.law of fr.prestations.versement (wave 5).
// Effective window [@2024-01-01, infinity): L. 553-2 is pinned only
// from CSS_ED2024_01 and the 10 % sentences run from 2024-01-01
// (loi 2022-1616 art. 100); pre-2024 paragraphs are reserved, not encoded.
//
// WHAT THIS LAYER OWNS. For one monthly echeance of benefit Y, given
// the recoverable debts charged to it and the fund-stated scale rate,
// derive the monthly deduction and the net paid amount. Limitation is
// per-debt, never echeance-wide (D-V5): PF prescription drops the PF
// indu+indemnity via DetteAfPrescrit while the RSA carry survives;
// RSA limitation arrives pre-encoded in the imported indu_recouvrable.
// Norms owned elsewhere are NOT redefined (D-V1): L. 553-1/2/2-1/3/4/5
// live in fr.pf.core modules 06/07; this layer only IMPORTS their heads
// and applies them across benefits.
//
// FINDINGS (quotes in the S3 report; bytes pinned unless noted MIRROR):
//   PF (reference) — L. 553-2 al. 1 (pinned, CSS_ED2024_01+): primary
//     recovery by deductions from future benefits; overflow onto the
//     future echeances of housing (CCH L. 821-1), AJPA (L. 168-8), book VIII
//     titles II and IV (= AAH + PA on the mirror hierarchy reading —
//     MIRROR-pending, never pinned; AAH-carry inputs stay fund-stated
//     with the inference flagged), and RSA. 10 % fraud indemnity al. 1.
//     Scale + uplift up
//     to 50 % + doubling on repeat within 5 years al. 3; the scale
//     sentence expressly covers the L. 821-5-1, L. 845-3, CCH L. 823-9
//     and L. 262-46 retenues. Limitation L. 553-1: 2 years, 5 years on
//     fraud, interruption while a listed recovery procedure runs.
//   RSA — L. 262-46 al. 4 PINNED: overflow onto AJPA, PF (L. 511-1),
//     PA (L. 841-1), book VIII title II (AAH only via the mirror
//     hierarchy inference — MIRROR, same as the PF leg), housing
//     (L. 821-1 CCH).
//     10 % indemnity PINNED from 2024-01-01 (loi 2022-1616 art. 100;
//     the PRE2024 text lacks it). Scale renvoi to L. 553-2 al. 3
//     PINNED (both versions) → uplift + doubling apply. Limitation
//     L. 262-45 PINNED: 2 years, "sauf en cas de fraude ou de fausse
//     declaration" with NO 5-year period stated (SILENCE on the fraud
//     duration). Appeals suspensive (al. 2) arrives pre-encoded in the
//     imported indu_recouvrable — no defeater here. The 77 EUR floor
//     (R. 262-92), remise, tiers-payant and R. 262-92-1 notification
//     likewise arrive via indu_recouvrable/indemnite_fraude (rs 05).
//   AAH — recovery article L. 821-5-1 MIRROR-ONLY (VIGUEUR 2024-01-01;
//     overflow AJPA/PF/PA/housing/RSA; 10 % from 2024). Limitation
//     L. 821-5 PINNED (2 years, fraud exception, no 5-year period).
//     The deduction MATH for AAH retenues is pinned-grounded through
//     L. 553-2 al. 3, whose scope sentence covers L. 821-5-1 retenues;
//     the recovery permission itself awaits pinning (noted per rule).
//   PA — neighbour package pinned (W4-PPA DONE) and WIRED here (Y = PA
//     section, RSA pattern; B-PV-PA follow-up 6 closed): L. 845-3 al. 1-3
//     (own recovery by deductions from future amounts; 10 % fraud
//     indemnity from 2024-01-01, PRE2024 lacks it; suspensive appeals;
//     single-repayment option; scale renvoi to L. 553-2 al. 3) and
//     L. 845-4 ("L. 553-1 is applicable") arrive pre-encoded in the
//     imported indu_recupere/indemnite_fraude. Incoming carries onto
//     the PA echeance: RSA only (L. 262-46 al. 4 cites L. 841-1,
//     pinned); PF/AAH/housing→PA pairs reserved (B-PV-PA-CARRY).
//     Outgoing PA-source carries onto AF/RSA/AAH/housing are WIRED
//     (L. 845-3 al. 3 destination list, FINISH-W2 cascade follow-up).
//   Housing — L. 823-9 CCH MIRROR-ONLY: L. 553-2 "applicable au
//     recouvrement" (overflow housing/AJPA/AAH+PA/RSA; PF is NOT in
//     the overflow list — SILENCE, no housing-to-PF input). Housing
//     LIMITATION is SILENCE in the current CCH (old L. 351-11, which
//     held a 2-year rule, was abrogated 2019-09-01; L. 823-9 cites
//     L. 553-2 but not L. 553-1): no defeater is possible even in
//     principle. R. 825-2 is recours-administratif procedure only.
//   L. 844-3 (cited by the pinned L. 553-1 text with a "(1)" marker)
//     has NO article in the CSS mirror, abrogés included: orphan
//     reference, reported, not encoded.
//
// INPUT CONTRACTS (caller-side shaping, 03 precedent; all amounts
// explicit per case, zero when none):
//   (a) The single-repayment option conditions the AF, RSA, PA, CF,
//       ASF and ARS application rules directly (imported no-option
//       facts); AAH and housing options are neighbour-internal: their
//       charged inputs arrive net of any option taken. AJPA carries
//       are gated by lawful-carry facts attesting the source options.
//   (b) The monthly levy is a Money amount, never a rate: PF levies
//       arrive computed from the 06 bareme layer (prelevement_mensuel);
//       non-PF levies arrive fund-stated under the decree/DSS scale
//       (DSS_PENDING: percentages and exact base unpinned). No scale
//       percentage literal appears anywhere in this file, and no
//       installment x rate product is derived (PC-R07-39).
//   (c) The fraud uplift is the FIXED 50 % of D. 553-5 (x1.50),
//       doubled on 5-year repeat (x2.00, L. 553-2 al. 3), computed
//       in-section from a stated fraud/repeat status — never a
//       fund-stated fraction (PC-R07-38). Repeat statuses are
//       imported (PF) or stated per family (RSA/AAH/housing/PA/AJPA).
//   (d) One recoverable debt per debtor per case, charged to ONE head
//       per case: AF is the hub for PF indu + RSA/PA carries; CF/ASF/
//       ARS take a caller-charged amount when the case routes recovery
//       there. Multi-indu ledgers, month-to-month balance exhaustion
//       and simultaneous multi-head deduction are OUT (NO-LEDGER):
//       retenue = min(levy, echeance, dette) for the current month.
//   (e) Missing inputs mean silence, not zero: without a stated debt,
//       levy, carry or echeance, no payment fact derives. Compliant
//       callers state all amounts explicitly, zero when none; every
//       carry pair carries a lawful-carry gate fact (report_*_licite:
//       no carry, or carry à défaut with no source single option).
//   (f) PAJE (prime/base/prepare), CMG and AJPP recovery tracks are
//       QUEUED (B-PV-PF-TRACKS, PC-R07-36 remainder): distinct debtor
//       keys (PAJE Menage) and multi-child echeance allocation need a
//       debtor-identity/allocation design this return does not invent.
//       CF/ASF/ARS/AJPA tracks are WIRED below.
//
// CASCADE. Echeances are post-02/post-03: AF/CF/ASF/ARS read the
// same-package montant_net_crds_* (02); RSA reads allocation_mensuelle
// (neighbour applies the 6 EUR floor; CRDS-exempt); AAH reads
// aah_montant_du (CRDS-exempt; 03 SILENCE, brut passes through);
// housing reads fr.apl.versement::montant_verse (final net); PA reads
// prime_due_trimestre (neighbour applies the minimum-payment floor;
// no CRDS net for PA — B-PV-PA-CRDS; quarterly served amount —
// B-PV-PA-TRIMESTRE); AJPA reads ajpa_montant_mois (neighbour brut,
// silence benefits keep neighbour duties — no CRDS net). Whether CRDS
// also bites the post-recovery remainder is 05's ordering, not
// decided here.
//
// IDENTITY. Each family is keyed on its own neighbour person type;
// there is no cross-package person-identity bridge in the corpus, so a
// carried debt (e.g. an RSA indu deducted from AF) arrives as a
// fund-stated input on the PAYEE's key. The legal permission for each
// carried pair is documented on the input (pinned pairs only; mirror
// pairs are reserved in the report, never encoded).
//
// BOUNDARIES (see README for the register).
//   B-PV-PRESCRIPTION-SPLIT (D-V5/Q5). Limitation is encoded only for
//     the debt whose key the echeance carries: PF prescription drops
//     the PF component on AF echeances (DetteAfPrescrit); RSA-side
//     limitation arrives via indu_recouvrable. PF-carried debts on
//     RSA/AAH/housing echeances cannot be prescription-tested here
//     (PF key unreachable from those keys — IDENTITY), and RSA/AAH
//     own-limitation on non-RSA echeances is likewise unencoded.
//   B-PV-DROIT-PAIEMENT (Q7). 05 duties are ENTITLEMENT duties (droit:
//     the fund owes the computed net); 04 nets are PAYABLE amounts
//     (paiement: entitlement minus lawful deductions). The fund
//     discharges a 05 duty by paying the 04 net when 04 fires for
//     that echeance, else the 02/03 net. No rule links the stages:
//     linking needs the debt as a duty premise (18 more duties),
//     refused as over-modelling.
//   B-PV-SUBSIDIARITE (D9, explicit since PC-R07-36). "A défaut"
//     is attested per carry pair by a lawful-carry gate fact
//     (report_*_licite: no carry, or carry stated only after
//     own-benefit recovery failed and with no source single-
//     repayment option). No rule second-guesses the fund's
//     chargeability assessment beyond requiring the gate.
//
// WIRING AT PROMOTION. (1) DONE: fr.casf.rsa / fr.css.aah imports
// are in package.law/law.toml. (2) DONE: all 7 requested fr.pf.core
// 06/07 heads are pub (f33466c281 + be74ee4ba6; journal request 1
// closed); 6 are consumed here — indu_recupere_retenues stays
// unreferenced (this layer derives its own retenue_appliquee_*).
// (3) DONE: `law fix imports` is clean.
// (4) RESOLVED: no `not` over qualified heads is used (not_known
// throughout) and no defeaters remain. (5) PARTIAL (PC-R07-36):
// CF/ASF/ARS/AJPA tracks WIRED below (AF pattern); PAJE/CMG/AJPP
// tracks QUEUED under B-PV-PF-TRACKS (contract (f)).
// (6) PA (B-PV-PA follow-up 6, FINISH-W2): DONE —
// fr.css.prime_activite import + Y = PA section (RSA pattern,
// 8 rules); PA-source carries onto AF/RSA/AAH/housing DONE
// (cascade follow-up; remainder in B-PV-PA-CARRY per destination).
//
language "law.core" version "0.2";
package fr.prestations.versement version "0.1.0";
namespace "urn:fr:corpus:clir:prestations-versement";

use self::{
    montant_net_crds_af,
    montant_net_crds_ars,
    montant_net_crds_asf,
    montant_net_crds_cf,
    prelevement_mensuel,
};

// --- Shared arithmetic (Decimal literals only; no Integer literals) ---

function dette_totale2(a: Money, b: Money) -> Money =
    a + b;

function dette_totale3(a: Money, b: Money, c: Money) -> Money =
    a + b + c;

function dette_totale4(a: Money, b: Money, c: Money, d: Money) -> Money =
    a + b + c + d;

// D. 553-5: the fraud uplift rate is FIXED at 50 % (no fund-stated
// fraction); doubled on repeat within five years (L. 553-2 al. 3).
function retenue_majoree_fraude(retenue: Money) -> Money =
    retenue * 1.50;

function retenue_majoree_reiteration(retenue: Money) -> Money =
    retenue * 2.00;

// L. 553-2/D. 553-1: the single monthly retention, capped by the
// current due installment actually available and the remaining debt.
function retenue_plafonnee(retenue: Money, echeance: Money, dette: Money) -> Money =
    min(min(retenue, echeance), dette);

function net_apres_retenue(echeance: Money, retenue: Money) -> Money =
    echeance - retenue;

// --- Y = AF (PF family; full pf-core wiring) ----------------------------
// Echeance: same-package montant_net_crds_af (02, post-CRDS). Own debt:
// imported indu_constate + imported indemnite_frais_gestion (07 owns
// the 10 %). Carried debts: RSA indu (L. 262-46 al. 4, pinned) and PA
// indu (L. 845-3 al. 3 "prestations ... L. 511-1", pinned, FINISH-W2
// cascade follow-up). AAH-carried pairs are mirror-only (L. 821-5-1):
// reserved. Housing-carried: SILENCE (L. 553-2 overflow list has no
// PF entry).

pub relation rsa_indu_reporte_sur_pf(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(p);
    label fr official "indu de RSA imputé par la caisse sur les prestations familiales à échoir (L. 262-46 al. 4), hors option unique";
    label en unofficial "RSA overpayment charged by the fund to future family benefits (L. 262-46 para. 4), net of single-repayment option";
}

pub relation pa_indu_reporte_sur_pf(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(p);
    label fr official "indu de prime d'activité imputé par la caisse sur les prestations familiales à échoir (L. 845-3 al. 3, L. 511-1), hors option unique";
    label en unofficial "activity-bonus overpayment charged by the fund to future family benefits (L. 845-3 para. 3, L. 511-1), net of single-repayment option";
}

pub relation report_rsa_sur_pf_licite(p: fr.pf.core::Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "report RSA→PF licite : aucun report imputé, ou report imputé à défaut de recouvrement sur le RSA et sans option unique RSA, fait constaté (L. 262-46 al. 4 « à défaut »)";
    label en unofficial "lawful RSA→PF carry: no carry charged, or carry charged for want of RSA recovery with no RSA single option, stated fact (L. 262-46 para. 4 'à défaut')";
}

pub relation report_pa_sur_pf_licite(p: fr.pf.core::Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "report PA→PF licite : aucun report imputé, ou report imputé à défaut de recouvrement sur la prime et sans option unique PA, fait constaté (L. 845-3 al. 3 « à défaut »)";
    label en unofficial "lawful PA→PF carry: no carry charged, or carry charged for want of bonus recovery with no PA single option, stated fact (L. 845-3 para. 3 'à défaut')";
}

pub relation dette_recouvrable_af(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(p);
    label fr official "dette totale imputée sur l'échéance d'AF du mois (indu PF + indemnité + reports RSA et PA)";
    label en unofficial "total debt charged to the month's AF echeance (PF indu + indemnity + RSA and PA carries)";
}

pub relation retenue_effective_af(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(p);
    label fr official "retenue mensuelle effective sur l'AF après majoration éventuelle : prélèvement D. 553-1, +50 % fraude, x2 réitération (L. 553-2 al. 3, D. 553-5)";
    label en unofficial "effective monthly AF retention after any uplift: D. 553-1 levy, +50% fraud, x2 repeat (L. 553-2 para. 3, D. 553-5)";
}

pub relation retenue_appliquee_af(p: fr.pf.core::Personne) kind institutional {
    key(p);
    label fr official "le recouvrement par retenues s'applique à l'échéance d'AF (option unique non exercée)";
    label en unofficial "recovery by deductions applies to the AF echeance (single-repayment option not taken)";
}

pub relation retenue_mensuelle_af(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(p);
    label fr official "retenue mensuelle prélevée sur l'échéance d'AF";
    label en unofficial "monthly deduction taken from the AF echeance";
}

pub relation net_verse_af(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(p);
    label fr official "montant d'AF versé après retenue (ou échéance entière si le recouvrement est écarté)";
    label en unofficial "AF amount paid after deduction (or the full echeance when recovery is barred)";
}

// Dette = PF indu + RSA carry; no fraud, so no indemnity (07 derives
// indemnite_frais_gestion exactly when indu_frauduleux holds).

@source(fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_09, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_04,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_06, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_01, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_06,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2026_06,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2024_01_01,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_01_01,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_02_28,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_03_31,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2026_04_01)
rule DetteAfNonFraude(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, indu: Money, reporte: Money, pa: Money) defeasible {
    effective [@2024-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "dette AF hors fraude : indu PF + reports RSA et PA (L. 553-2 al. 1, L. 262-46 al. 4, L. 845-3 al. 3)";
    label en unofficial "AF debt without fraud: PF indu + RSA and PA carries (L. 553-2 para. 1, L. 262-46 para. 4, L. 845-3 para. 3)";
    when fr.pf.core::indu_constate(p, indu) and rsa_indu_reporte_sur_pf(p, reporte)
        and pa_indu_reporte_sur_pf(p, pa)
        and report_rsa_sur_pf_licite(p) and report_pa_sur_pf_licite(p)
        and not_known(fr.pf.core::indu_frauduleux(p))
        and not_known(fr.pf.core::action_prescrite(p));
    then dette_recouvrable_af(p, dette_totale3(indu, reporte, pa));
}

// Dette with fraud: the imported 07 indemnity joins the debt (L. 553-2
// al. 1: "recouvrée dans les mêmes conditions que les indus").

@source(fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_09, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_04,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_06, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_01, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_06,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2026_06,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2024_01_01,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_01_01,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_02_28,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_03_31,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2026_04_01)
rule DetteAfFraude(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, indu: Money, reporte: Money, indemnite: Money, pa: Money) defeasible {
    effective [@2024-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "dette AF en cas de fraude : indu + indemnité 10 % + reports RSA et PA";
    label en unofficial "AF debt on fraud: indu + 10% indemnity + RSA and PA carries";
    when fr.pf.core::indu_constate(p, indu) and rsa_indu_reporte_sur_pf(p, reporte)
        and pa_indu_reporte_sur_pf(p, pa)
        and report_rsa_sur_pf_licite(p) and report_pa_sur_pf_licite(p)
        and fr.pf.core::indu_frauduleux(p) and fr.pf.core::indemnite_frais_gestion(p, indemnite)
        and not_known(fr.pf.core::action_prescrite(p));
    then dette_recouvrable_af(p, dette_totale4(indu, reporte, indemnite, pa));
}

// D-V5 per-debt limitation: a time-barred PF action (L. 553-1) drops the
// PF indu AND its indemnity from the debt, but the RSA carry (L. 262-46
// al. 4 action) and the PA carry (L. 845-3 al. 3 action) survive — no
// echeance-wide defeater (over/under-blocking both refused). Prescribed
// + zero carries yields a zero dette, hence a zero retenue and the
// full echeance.

@source(fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2021_05,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2021_11, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2021_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2022_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2022_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2022_03, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2022_09,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2023_07, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2024_01,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2025_02, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2025_09,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2025_12, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2026_01,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2026_04, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_1_CSS_ED2026_06,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_01,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_06, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2026_06,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2024_01_01,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_01_01,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_02_28,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_03_31,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2026_04_01)
rule DetteAfPrescrit(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, indu: Money, reporte: Money, pa: Money) defeasible {
    effective [@2024-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "action prescrite (L. 553-1) : seuls les reports RSA et PA restent recouvrables";
    label en unofficial "action time-barred (L. 553-1): only the RSA and PA carries stay recoverable";
    when fr.pf.core::indu_constate(p, indu) and rsa_indu_reporte_sur_pf(p, reporte)
        and pa_indu_reporte_sur_pf(p, pa)
        and report_rsa_sur_pf_licite(p) and report_pa_sur_pf_licite(p)
        and fr.pf.core::action_prescrite(p);
    then dette_recouvrable_af(p, dette_totale2(reporte, pa));
}

// Base retention without fraud: the D. 553-1 monthly levy (06 scale)
// applies as is — no rate, no installment product.

@source(fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_09, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_04,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_06)
rule RetenueBaseAf(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, base: Money) strict {
    effective [@2024-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "hors fraude : le prélèvement mensuel D. 553-1 s'applique sans majoration";
    label en unofficial "without fraud: the D. 553-1 monthly levy applies without uplift";
    when prelevement_mensuel(p, base) and not_known(fr.pf.core::indu_frauduleux(p));
    then retenue_effective_af(p, base);
}

// "En cas de fraude, le directeur ... peut majorer" — organ power,
// hence defeasible; excluded on repeat so the strict doubling wins.
// The uplift is the FIXED 50 % of D. 553-5 (x1.50), never a stated
// fraction.

@source(fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_09, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_04,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_06,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2021_05,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2021_11, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2021_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2022_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2022_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2022_03, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2022_09,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2023_07, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2024_01,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2025_02, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2025_09,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2025_12, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2026_01,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2026_04, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2026_06)
rule RetenueFraudeAf(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, base: Money) defeasible {
    effective [@2024-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "en cas de fraude : majoration fixe de 50 % du prélèvement (pouvoir du directeur, L. 553-2 al. 3, D. 553-5)";
    label en unofficial "on fraud: fixed 50% uplift of the levy (director's power, L. 553-2 para. 3, D. 553-5)";
    when prelevement_mensuel(p, base)
        and fr.pf.core::indu_frauduleux(p) and not_known(fr.pf.core::fraude_reiteree(p));
    then retenue_effective_af(p, retenue_majoree_fraude(base));
}

// "Ce taux est doublé en cas de réitération ..." — mandatory, strict,
// driven by the imported 07 repeat-fraud status (5-year condition).

@source(fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_09, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_04,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_06,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2021_05,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2021_11, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2021_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2022_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2022_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2022_03, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2022_09,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2023_07, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2024_01,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2025_02, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2025_09,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2025_12, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2026_01,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2026_04, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2026_06)
rule RetenueReiterationAf(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, base: Money) strict {
    effective [@2024-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "réitération dans les cinq ans : la majoration de 50 % est doublée (x2,00)";
    label en unofficial "repeat within five years: the 50% uplift is doubled (x2.00)";
    when prelevement_mensuel(p, base)
        and fr.pf.core::indu_frauduleux(p) and fr.pf.core::fraude_reiteree(p);
    then retenue_effective_af(p, retenue_majoree_reiteration(base));
}

// Deductions apply unless the single-repayment option was taken (07
// pattern). Defeasible so a future bar can remove the status without
// touching the rule; limitation itself is per-debt (DetteAfPrescrit,
// D-V5), never an echeance-wide defeater.

@source(fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_09, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_04,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_06, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_01, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_06,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2026_06)
rule RetenueAppliqueeAf(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, dette: Money, base: Money, echeance: Money) defeasible {
    effective [@2024-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "retenues sur l'AF à échoir, sauf remboursement unique (L. 553-2 al. 1)";
    label en unofficial "deductions from future AF, absent single repayment (L. 553-2 para. 1)";
    when dette_recouvrable_af(p, dette) and retenue_effective_af(p, base)
        and montant_net_crds_af(p, echeance) and not_known(fr.pf.core::option_remboursement_unique(p));
    then retenue_appliquee_af(p);
}

@source(fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_09, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_04,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_06, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_01, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_06,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2026_06)
rule RetenueMontantAf(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, dette: Money, base: Money, echeance: Money) defeasible {
    effective [@2024-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "retenue AF du mois : prélèvement effectif, plafonné à l'échéance et à la dette";
    label en unofficial "month's AF deduction: effective levy, capped at the echeance and the debt";
    when retenue_appliquee_af(p) and dette_recouvrable_af(p, dette)
        and retenue_effective_af(p, base) and montant_net_crds_af(p, echeance);
    then retenue_mensuelle_af(p, retenue_plafonnee(base, echeance, dette));
}

@source(fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_09, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_04,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_06, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_01, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_06,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2026_06)
rule NetVerseAf(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, echeance: Money, retenue: Money) defeasible {
    effective [@2024-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "AF versée : échéance nette de CRDS moins la retenue";
    label en unofficial "AF paid: net-of-CRDS echeance minus the deduction";
    when montant_net_crds_af(p, echeance) and retenue_mensuelle_af(p, retenue);
    then net_verse_af(p, net_apres_retenue(echeance, retenue));
}

// Recovery assessed but barred by the single-repayment option: the
// full echeance is paid. The dette + taux + echeance inputs prove the
// assessment happened; absence of the status proves the option.
// (Prescription is per-debt since D-V5: DetteAfPrescrit.)

@source(fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_09, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_04,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_06, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_01, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_06,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2026_06)
rule NetSansRetenueAf(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, dette: Money, base: Money, echeance: Money) defeasible {
    effective [@2024-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "recouvrement écarté : l'échéance d'AF est versée entière";
    label en unofficial "recovery barred: the AF echeance is paid in full";
    when dette_recouvrable_af(p, dette) and retenue_effective_af(p, base)
        and montant_net_crds_af(p, echeance) and not_known(retenue_appliquee_af(p));
    then net_verse_af(p, echeance);
}

// --- Y = RSA (full pinned chain L. 262-46 + L. 553-2) -------------------
// Echeance: imported allocation_mensuelle (neighbour applies the 6 EUR
// floor; CRDS-exempt). Own debt: imported indu_recouvrable — the
// neighbour's 05 chain (77 EUR floor, notification, 2-year/interrupted/
// fraud limitation, no suspensive appeal) is consumed, never re-derived
// (D-V1). The 10 % fraud indemnity is imported too
// (fr.casf.rsa::indemnite_fraude). Carried debts: PF indu (L. 553-2
// al. 1 overflow lists RSA, pinned) and PA indu (L. 845-3 al. 3
// "RSA L. 262-1", pinned, FINISH-W2 cascade follow-up).
// AAH/housing-carried pairs are mirror-only (L. 821-5-1/L. 823-9):
// reserved. The RSA
// single-repayment option conditions the application rule directly
// (Q2 symmetry with PF). No appeal defeater: suspensif is already
// encoded in indu_recouvrable (neighbour InduRecouvrable* requires
// not_known(recours_suspensif)).

pub relation retenue_mensuelle_rsa_declaree(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(p);
    label fr official "montant mensuel du prélèvement appliqué par la caisse selon le barème D. 553-1 (renvoi L. 262-46, échelle DSS non épinglée : DSS_PENDING)";
    label en unofficial "monthly levy amount applied by the fund under the D. 553-1 scale (L. 262-46 renvoi, DSS scale bytes unpinned: DSS_PENDING)";
}

pub relation fraude_repetee_5ans_rsa(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "réitération de la fraude dans les cinq ans suivant une précédente fraude, fait constaté (L. 553-2 al. 3 via renvoi L. 262-46)";
    label en unofficial "repeat fraud within five years after a previous fraud, stated fact (L. 553-2 para. 3 via L. 262-46 renvoi)";
}

pub relation pf_indu_reporte_sur_rsa(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(p);
    label fr official "indu de prestations familiales imputé par la caisse sur le RSA à échoir (L. 553-2 al. 1), hors option unique";
    label en unofficial "family-benefit overpayment charged by the fund to future RSA (L. 553-2 para. 1), net of single-repayment option";
}

pub relation pa_indu_reporte_sur_rsa(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(p);
    label fr official "indu de prime d'activité imputé par la caisse sur le RSA à échoir (L. 845-3 al. 3, L. 262-1), hors option unique";
    label en unofficial "activity-bonus overpayment charged by the fund to future RSA (L. 845-3 para. 3, L. 262-1), net of single-repayment option";
}

pub relation report_pf_sur_rsa_licite(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "report PF→RSA licite : aucun report imputé, ou report imputé à défaut de recouvrement sur les prestations familiales et sans option unique PF, fait constaté (L. 553-2 al. 1 « à défaut »)";
    label en unofficial "lawful PF→RSA carry: no carry charged, or carry charged for want of family-benefit recovery with no PF single option, stated fact (L. 553-2 para. 1 'à défaut')";
}

pub relation report_pa_sur_rsa_licite(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "report PA→RSA licite : aucun report imputé, ou report imputé à défaut de recouvrement sur la prime et sans option unique PA, fait constaté (L. 845-3 al. 3 « à défaut »)";
    label en unofficial "lawful PA→RSA carry: no carry charged, or carry charged for want of bonus recovery with no PA single option, stated fact (L. 845-3 para. 3 'à défaut')";
}

pub relation dette_recouvrable_rsa(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(p);
    label fr official "dette totale imputée sur l'échéance de RSA du mois (indu RSA + indemnité + reports PF et PA)";
    label en unofficial "total debt charged to the month's RSA echeance (RSA indu + indemnity + PF and PA carries)";
}

pub relation retenue_effective_rsa(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(p);
    label fr official "retenue mensuelle effective sur le RSA après majoration éventuelle : barème D. 553-1, +50 % fraude, x2 réitération (L. 262-46, renvoi L. 553-2 al. 3, D. 553-5)";
    label en unofficial "effective monthly RSA retention after any uplift: D. 553-1 scale, +50% fraud, x2 repeat (L. 262-46, renvoi to L. 553-2 para. 3, D. 553-5)";
}

pub relation retenue_appliquee_rsa(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne) kind institutional {
    key(p);
    label fr official "le recouvrement par retenues s'applique à l'échéance de RSA (option unique non exercée)";
    label en unofficial "recovery by deductions applies to the RSA echeance (single-repayment option not taken)";
}

pub relation retenue_mensuelle_rsa(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne, mois: Date, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(p, mois);
    label fr official "retenue mensuelle prélevée sur l'échéance de RSA du mois";
    label en unofficial "monthly deduction taken from the month's RSA echeance";
}

pub relation net_verse_rsa(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne, mois: Date, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(p, mois);
    label fr official "montant de RSA versé après retenue (ou échéance entière si le recouvrement est écarté)";
    label en unofficial "RSA amount paid after deduction (or the full echeance when recovery is barred)";
}

@source(fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_01,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_06, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2026_06,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_09, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_04,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_06,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2024_01_01,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_01_01,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_02_28,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_03_31,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2026_04_01)
rule DetteRsaNonFraude(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne, indu: Money, reporte: Money, pa: Money) strict {
    effective [@2024-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "dette RSA hors fraude : indu recouvrable + reports PF et PA (L. 262-46 al. 3, L. 553-2 al. 1, L. 845-3 al. 3)";
    label en unofficial "RSA debt without fraud: recoverable indu + PF and PA carries (L. 262-46 para. 3, L. 553-2 para. 1, L. 845-3 para. 3)";
    when fr.casf.rsa::indu_recouvrable(p, indu) and pf_indu_reporte_sur_rsa(p, reporte)
        and pa_indu_reporte_sur_rsa(p, pa)
        and report_pf_sur_rsa_licite(p) and report_pa_sur_rsa_licite(p)
        and not_known(fr.casf.rsa::indu_fraude(p));
    then dette_recouvrable_rsa(p, dette_totale3(indu, reporte, pa));
}

@source(fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_01,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_06, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2026_06,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_09, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_04,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_06,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2024_01_01,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_01_01,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_02_28,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2025_03_31,
        fr.css.prime_activite::CSS_L845_3_ED2026_04_01)
rule DetteRsaFraude(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne, indu: Money, reporte: Money, indemnite: Money, pa: Money) strict {
    effective [@2024-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "dette RSA en cas de fraude : indu recouvrable + indemnité 10 % + reports PF et PA";
    label en unofficial "RSA debt on fraud: recoverable indu + 10% indemnity + PF and PA carries";
    when fr.casf.rsa::indu_recouvrable(p, indu) and pf_indu_reporte_sur_rsa(p, reporte)
        and pa_indu_reporte_sur_rsa(p, pa)
        and report_pf_sur_rsa_licite(p) and report_pa_sur_rsa_licite(p)
        and fr.casf.rsa::indu_fraude(p) and fr.casf.rsa::indemnite_fraude(p, indemnite);
    then dette_recouvrable_rsa(p, dette_totale4(indu, reporte, indemnite, pa));
}

// Scale mechanics reach RSA through the pinned renvoi ("Les retenues
// ... sont déterminées en application des règles prévues au troisième
// alinéa de l'article L. 553-2"), so both fragments ground these rules.

@source(fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_01,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_06, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2026_06,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_09, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_04,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_06)
rule RetenueBaseRsa(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne, base: Money) strict {
    effective [@2024-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "hors fraude : le prélèvement mensuel déclaré s'applique sans majoration";
    label en unofficial "without fraud: the stated monthly levy applies without uplift";
    when retenue_mensuelle_rsa_declaree(p, base) and not_known(fr.casf.rsa::indu_fraude(p));
    then retenue_effective_rsa(p, base);
}

// "Peut majorer" stays defeasible, mirroring the PF rule; the uplift
// is the FIXED 50 % of D. 553-5 (x1.50). Repeat doubling is governed
// by the stated 5-year repeat status (strict rule below).

@source(fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_01,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_06, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2026_06,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_09, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_04,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_06,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2021_05,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2021_11, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2021_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2022_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2022_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2022_03, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2022_09,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2023_07, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2024_01,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2025_02, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2025_09,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2025_12, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2026_01,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2026_04, fr.pf.core::CSS_D553_5_CSS_ED2026_06)
rule RetenueFraudeRsa(p: fr.minima.ressources::Personne, base: Money) defeasible {
    effective [@2024-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "en cas de fraude : majoration fixe de 50 % du prélèvement (pouvoir du directeur)";
    label en unofficial "on fraud: fixed 50% uplift of the levy (director's power)";
    when retenue_mensuelle_rsa_declaree(p, base)
        and fr.casf.rsa::indu_fraude(p) and not_known(fraude_repetee_5ans_rsa(p));
    then retenue_effective_rsa(p, retenue_majoree_fraude(base));
}

@source(fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_01,
        fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2025_06, fr.casf.rsa::CASF_L262_46_ED2026_06,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_02,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_09, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2025_12,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_01, fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_04,
        fr.pf.core::CSS_L553_2_CSS_ED2026_06,
